    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "France talks about a new "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "tax",
            "zh": "税"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for very rich people. It is a 2% tax on people with more than 100 million "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "euros",
            "zh": "欧元"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". About 1,800 people in France would pay this tax."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Supporters",
            "ref": "v-supporter"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " say that it is "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fair",
            "ref": "v-fair"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It gives more money for schools, hospitals and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "army",
            "ref": "v-army"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They say that the tax can bring 20 billion euros in France and even more in Europe. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Critics",
            "zh": "批评者"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " do not like the idea. They think that rich people may stop "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "investing",
            "zh": "投资"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or try not to pay."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some countries already have a tax like this, for example, Spain, Norway and Switzerland. In France, the old tax ended in 2018, but people still pay a tax on houses and land."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
